# ArtNet Lightshow no longer reads configuration from the environment.
#
# Everything — Art-Net target, MIDI ports, Spotify and Deezer credentials,
# playback sources, analysis timeouts, bind address, port and access token —
# is configured in the settings page:
#
#     http://localhost:3000/settings.html
#
# Your choices are stored in config/settings.json (mode 0600, gitignored),
# which the server creates on first save. Anything you have not set uses the
# built-in default, so there is nothing to copy or fill in here to get started.
#
# If you have an old .env, the server names the variables it is ignoring at
# startup. Set those values once in the settings page, then delete the file.
#
# The one remaining environment variable is a developer log toggle, not a
# setting:
#
#DEBUG_MIDI=1   # log every incoming MIDI message
